<title>CROATIA: Croatia Dec unemployment rises to 15.9 vs 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatia Dec unemployment rises to 15.9 vs 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT   DEC '96    NOV '96   DEC '95</p>
<p>Total jobless	    269,263    266,644   249,070</p>
<p>Unemployment rate</p>
<p>(percent)		  15.9	 15.7	17.6</p>
<p>NOTE- The unemployment rate fell to under 16 percent in September 1996 after total workforce was revised to include farmers, army and police. The figures for 1995 and the first few months of 1996 were not revised. Data exclude jobless in the Serb-held region of eastern Slavonia</p>
</text>
